Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}恐怕就无法挽留她了 当然我也不怪她\N{\fs10}I don't think it's gonna really work out for me and I wouldn't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.53,0:09:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}复仇者联盟是一批很独特的超级英雄\N{\fs10}Avengers are a very unique group of superheroes...
