Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}从来没听说你也是复仇者\N{\fs10}I wasn't aware that you were an Avenger.
