Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.51,0:10:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你的超能力是什么 侧方停车？\N{\fs10}What's your superpower? Is it parallel parking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}非常抱歉\N{\fs10}I am so sorry.
