Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}看到不同了吗\N{\fs10}Do you see the distinction?
