Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.30,0:10:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}问题可能在于...\N{\fs10}Now, the problem might be that you're...
