Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你的出发点很好 我相信你\N{\fs10}Right? I think you got a good heart. I believe what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但并非人人都是当英雄的料 我就不是\N{\fs10}But not everybody's the world-saving type. I'm not,
