Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}上帝关上一扇门...\N{\fs10}When one door closes...
