Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.15,0:11:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}严格来说 嘉华不是小厢旅\N{\fs10}Technically, the, the Carnival's not a minivan.
