Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-如果跟本田奥德赛比起来怎么样 -奥德赛？\N{\fs10}-So how does the Kia compare to the Honda Odyssey? -The Odyssey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}问得好 比那鸡巴车强多了\N{\fs10}That's a great question. It doesn't fucking suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你可以不带脏话来回答的\N{\fs10}You know, you can answer the question without swearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}抱歉 我没...我还没孩子\N{\fs10}I'm sorry, Tammy, I don't, I don't have kids.
