Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我理想是当销售？\N{\fs10}Look, is sales the best match?
