Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们是人类 渴望有成就感\N{\fs10}We're human beings. We crave purpose.
