Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.72,0:24:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}别成为他们想要的产物\N{\fs10}Don't be what they made you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.45,0:24:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}原来死亡是这种感觉...\N{\fs10}So this is what it feels like...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.45,0:24:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}罗根\N{\fs10}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.36,0:24:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}当然\N{\fs10}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.11,0:24:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}罗根\N{\fs10}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.87,0:24:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}罗根\N{\fs10}Logan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.33,0:24:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}手上长叉子的那个\N{\fs10}The guy with forks for hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.46,0:24:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}那个金刚狼\N{\fs10}That Wolverine?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.08,0:24:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}懂了\N{\fs10}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.10,0:24:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}现在把他死去的画面一关 就阻止他死去了\N{\fs10}You can turn your retro graphics of death off now. Make it stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们没去阻止 也根本阻止不了\N{\fs10}We're not doing it, Mr. Wilson. We certainly can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.17,0:24:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}那我们还剩多少时间\N{\fs10}How long have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.31,0:24:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}一般情况 还剩几千年\N{\fs10}In most cases, couple thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.73,0:24:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-那还好 -一般况其实不够快\N{\fs10}-Well, sweet. -Well, most cases aren't fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.98,0:24:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}对我来说\N{\fs10}Not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}什么意思\N{\fs10}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.68,0:24:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就是说我是被派来负责...\N{\fs10}It means that I have been tasked...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.93,0:24:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}监督你的宇宙终结\N{\fs10}with overseeing the end of your universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.36,0:24:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不管高层的人想用哪种处理方式\N{\fs10}And regardless of what the pencil pushers upstairs would prefer...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.15,0:24:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我不会...\N{\fs10}I will not...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:25:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}浪费生命盯着一个司空见惯的衰亡过程\N{\fs10}waste my life watching it die slowly of natural causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.19,0:25:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们以前都是直接删掉 干净俐落\N{\fs10}We used to just prune these things. Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.54,0:25:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}优雅又高效 但现在的时变局\N{\fs10}Elegant. Efficient. But I'm told the TVA...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.41,0:25:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}已经不允许那样了 但我喜欢\N{\fs10}doesn't like to do that anymore. Well I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.83,0:25:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不管所谓的高层怎么说\N{\fs10}And no matter what my so-called superiors say,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.56,0:25:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}多元宇宙不需要保姆\N{\fs10}the multiverse does not need a babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.17,0:25:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}而是需要一个慈悲杀手\N{\fs10}We need a mercy killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.13,0:25:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}在现在这个状况下\N{\fs10}And in this instance...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.78,0:25:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我就是那个慈悲杀手\N{\fs10}I am the mercy killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.22,0:25:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}那是干什么用的\N{\fs10}What in the MacGuffin is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.31,0:25:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}那是时间开膛手\N{\fs10}That's a Time Ripper, Mr. Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.64,0:25:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}一个加速装置\N{\fs10}An accelerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.35,0:25:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}启动它\N{\fs10}Once completed,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.61,0:25:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就能直接摧毁你们宇宙的时空矩阵\N{\fs10}it will allow me to destroy the spacetime matrix of your universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.11,0:25:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我不想只是个给时变局打工的\N{\fs10}You see, I don't want to work for the TVA.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.28,0:25:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我要成为时变局\N{\fs10}I want to be the TVA.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.53,0:25:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}首先得让这个组织的老家伙们明白\N{\fs10}And the first step involves showing this organization...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.16,0:25:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}有很多手段可以提高效率\N{\fs10}how much more efficient it can become.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.08,0:25:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就是说 我会让你的宇宙快速慈悲地终结\N{\fs10}To wit, I will be giving your universe a swift and compassionate end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}放心 你的朋友不会有什么痛苦\N{\fs10}And don't worry, your friends won't feel a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}结束时就像这样 那是什么\N{\fs10}It'll be over just like this. "Oh, what's that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.30,0:25:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}相信我\N{\fs10}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.10,0:26:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我的整个世界 你想一枪给它解脱了？\N{\fs10}You're gonna Old Yeller my fucking universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.99,0:26:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}用你们的说法 是的\N{\fs10}In your parlance, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.81,0:26:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}两枪胸口一枪头\N{\fs10}Two in the heart, one in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.29,0:26:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}威尔逊先生 你现在有两个选择\N{\fs10}Look, Mr. Wilson, you have two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.40,0:26:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}一是重回心爱的人身边 陪他们一起消失\N{\fs10}You can either rejoin your loved one sand collectively cease to exist in...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.77,0:26:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}可能还剩72个小时 或者...\N{\fs10}I'd say, seventy-two hours. Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.77,0:26:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}加入神圣时间线\N{\fs10}you join the Sacred Timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.49,0:26:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}结束你无足轻重\N{\fs10}And you end your days of insignificance...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.91,0:26:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}平凡无奇的日子\N{\fs10}and mediocrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.99,0:26:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}韦德\N{\fs10}Wade.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.62,0:26:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}韦德 你终于\N{\fs10}Wade, you can finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.55,0:26:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}终于可以\N{\fs10}finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.20,0:26:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}有作为了\N{\fs10}matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.68,0:26:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}那才是我真心想要的\N{\fs10}That's all I've ever really wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.89,0:26:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我知道\N{\fs10}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.76,0:26:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我知道\N{\fs10}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.72,0:26:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我一贯的道德底线就是没有底线\N{\fs10}And you know I'm, I'm nothing if not morally flexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.73,0:26:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}好\N{\fs10}Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.02,0:27:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我愿意\N{\fs10}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.19,0:27:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}明智的选择 神圣时间线欢迎你加入\N{\fs10}Wise choice. The Sacred Timeline's happy to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.68,0:27:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我不只要找到金刚狼 还要打断你的鼻子\N{\fs10}I was actually talking about finding the Wolverine and breaking your fucking nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.71,0:27:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}去找他 快去找他\N{\fs10}Find him. Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.22,0:27:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他确实找到了\N{\fs10}And boy, did he ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.84,0:27:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}所以我们回到了开始那一幕\N{\fs10}Which brings us back to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.43,0:27:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}继续亵渎这具神圣遗体\N{\fs10}The desecration of the sacred corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.73,0:27:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}老天啊\N{\fs10}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.79,0:27:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我操 我的胳膊\N{\fs10}My own fucking arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.11,0:27:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这才像话\N{\fs10}Now we're talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.32,0:27:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不是这样\N{\fs10}Not like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.78,0:27:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不 老天爷啊\N{\fs10}No, dear God! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.91,0:27:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}抱歉 金刚狼的爪子真的很难驾驭（双关语 hard亦有硬的意思）\N{\fs10}I'm sorry! Wolverine-ing is hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.25,0:27:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}快住手\N{\fs10}Make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.42,0:27:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}曼高德尽力了\N{\fs10}Mangold tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.42,0:28:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你这个人渣\N{\fs10}You sick fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.54,0:28:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}罗根是位英雄\N{\fs10}Logan was a hero.
