Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.91,0:43:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这里是虚空\N{\fs10}You're in The Void.
