Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.28,0:43:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我愿意 一言为定\N{\fs10}The answer is yes. Shake on it.
