Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.14,0:44:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就是她的奴隶\N{\fs10}or you work for her.
