Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.06,0:46:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但她能看见可卡因\N{\fs10}Except she can see cocaine.
