Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.22,0:46:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你是谁\N{\fs10}Who are you?
