Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.57,0:46:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-放屁 -我可能有点松\N{\fs10}-Bullshit! -I was an anal birth.
