Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.12,0:46:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}对不对 强尼\N{\fs10}Haven't I, Johnny?
