Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.25,0:46:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}强尼跟我们介绍过你\N{\fs10}Oh, Johnny told us all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.75,0:46:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-快闭嘴吧 -是吗\N{\fs10}-Maybe shut up now. -Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.91,0:46:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-还是别... -聊聊天而已\N{\fs10}-maybe don't... -We're just talking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.46,0:46:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}强尼说你是妄自尊大的傻逼神经病\N{\fs10}Yeah, Johnny told us you're a psychotic megalomaniacal asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.80,0:46:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他说的 不是我\N{\fs10}His words, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.72,0:46:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}沉迷于支配和痛苦\N{\fs10}Hellbent on domination and pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.31,0:47:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-你是这么说我的？ -不是\N{\fs10}-You said all that about me? -No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.43,0:47:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不是\N{\fs10}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.36,0:47:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-我根本没说过 -硬气点儿 强尼\N{\fs10}-I don't... I didn't say any of that! -Sticks and stones, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.40,0:47:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}别让她吓倒\N{\fs10}Don't let her intimidate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.57,0:47:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就像你在车上说的\N{\fs10}It's like you said in the convoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.32,0:47:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这个行尸走肉一般的嗜血妖女\N{\fs10}This finger-lickin' dead-inside pixie slab of...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.32,0:47:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}青石板胸豆奶稀\N{\fs10}third rate dime-store nut-milk...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.19,0:47:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}只适合舔他翘臀里面的原味菊花\N{\fs10}can eat your delicious cinnamon ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.16,0:47:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}事后再一路滚回她那秃顶的地狱\N{\fs10}and kick rocks all the way to bald hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.33,0:47:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我这辈子根本没说过这些话\N{\fs10}I have never said any of those words in my entire life!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.31,0:47:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}别谦虚\N{\fs10}The modesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.53,0:47:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}都以为我嘴贱 但跟他一比...\N{\fs10}People think I'm a shit talker. But this guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.88,0:47:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}小巫见大巫\N{\fs10}Next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.79,0:47:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}什么 这... 我...\N{\fs10}What? This... I... We...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.88,0:47:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我都听不懂那是什么意思\N{\fs10}I don't even know what half of that means!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.51,0:47:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-这什么... -我佩服得五体投地 真的\N{\fs10}-This... I... What? This... -My hat's off to you, sir. Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.94,0:47:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我没... 他在... 那是...\N{\fs10}I didn't... He's... That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.03,0:47:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我没有...\N{\fs10}I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.76,0:47:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不是我最喜欢的克里斯\N{\fs10}Not my favorite Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.15,0:47:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你这个蠢蛋 你把他害死了\N{\fs10}You stupid piece of shit. You just got him fucking killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.96,0:47:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我也很伤心\N{\fs10}We're all grieving!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.44,0:47:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你知道他片酬有多高吗\N{\fs10}PS, do you know what he was doing to the budget?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.19,0:47:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}艾利奥斯饿了\N{\fs10}Alioth is hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.95,0:47:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}应该有点误会\N{\fs10}There's been some kind of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.70,0:47:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}旁边这个大金毛是候补锚定者\N{\fs10}Big yellow is a back up Anchor Being...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.57,0:48:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我是漫威救世主 私下也可以叫我MJ\N{\fs10}and I'm Marvel Jesus. MJ, if you're nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.04,0:48:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你可能觉得有点难听 有另一个英国的狗东西\N{\fs10}This may be hard to hear, but there's another British villain...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.87,0:48:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}想摧毁我的宇宙 我要阻止他\N{\fs10}who's gonna destroy my universe and I'm gonna stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.25,0:48:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你看着可不像拯救世界的料\N{\fs10}Oh, honey, you don't really strike me as the world-saving type.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.79,0:48:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}说到痛处了？\N{\fs10}Did I hit a nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.83,0:48:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我本来不想这么说\N{\fs10}I didn't want it to come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.01,0:48:17.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}要么你配合我们\N{\fs10}Either you help us...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.19,0:48:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}否则我哥们儿这就唱一部《乐器推销员》\N{\fs10}or my friend here is gonna sing the entire second act of Music Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.39,0:48:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}完全不用暖嗓准备\N{\fs10}with zero warm-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.26,0:48:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}那张椅子哪来的\N{\fs10}Where'd you get the chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.76,0:48:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}偶尔也有查尔斯进来\N{\fs10}Well, once in a while, I do get a Charles through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.56,0:48:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但没有与我同一宇宙的\N{\fs10}Never mine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.14,0:48:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}反正\N{\fs10}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.66,0:48:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他也不想来找我\N{\fs10}He didn't care to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.44,0:48:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}Z世代就爱自怨自艾\N{\fs10}Gen Z and their trauma-bragging!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.11,0:48:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你就不能跟我们一样 化悲愤为力量\N{\fs10}Can't you just stuff it down, turn it into accomplishment...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.82,0:48:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}或者憋出癌症来吗\N{\fs10}or cancer like the rest of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.61,0:48:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我跟你们不一样\N{\fs10}But I'm not like the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.45,0:48:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}或许金刚狼除外\N{\fs10}Except maybe the Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.36,0:48:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们联手将令人闻风丧胆\N{\fs10}Now, we could be truly terrifying together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.00,0:48:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你有那么强\N{\fs10}You're that scary, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.42,0:48:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}时变局肯定这么认为\N{\fs10}The TVA certainly thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.83,0:48:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}因为我还不会走路 他们就送我过来了\N{\fs10}They sent me here before I could walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.42,0:48:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}那也是我最难忘的人生际遇\N{\fs10}And you know, it's the best thing that ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.55,0:48:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我爱这里\N{\fs10}I love it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.63,0:48:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你住在垃圾场里\N{\fs10}You live in a garbage dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.26,0:49:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们都知道谁才住在垃圾场里\N{\fs10}I think we both know who lives in the garbage dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.38,0:49:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}虚空对于我宛如天堂\N{\fs10}The Void is a paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.18,0:49:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我能在这里施展全部力量而不受制约\N{\fs10}I can wield my power here without shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.39,0:49:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}可惜没有查尔斯·赛维尔教我压制这股力量\N{\fs10}Unfortunately I had no Charles Xavier to teach me temperance.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.39,0:49:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你的查尔斯呢\N{\fs10}What about your Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.39,0:49:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他有保护你吗\N{\fs10}Did he protect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.32,0:49:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}让你感到安全吗\N{\fs10}Did he make you feel safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.57,0:49:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们是变种人 永远不会安全\N{\fs10}We're mutants. We're never safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.60,0:49:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我不想打架\N{\fs10}I don't want the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.46,0:49:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我跟你无冤无仇 我只想救我朋友\N{\fs10}I don't have any beef with you. I just want to save my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.25,0:49:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我...我想回家\N{\fs10}I just... I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.75,0:49:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我倒是能送你回家\N{\fs10}Well, the thing is, I could get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.74,0:49:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-太好了 -问题是我不想\N{\fs10}-Good. -But I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.34,0:49:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不太好\N{\fs10}Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.80,0:49:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你想要什么 韦德·威尔逊\N{\fs10}What do you want, Wade Wilson?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.30,0:49:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你的...\N{\fs10}Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.74,0:49:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}手指进来了 但没有快感\N{\fs10}fingers are inside me, but not in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.14,0:49:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我哥用念力就能进入别人的脑袋\N{\fs10}My brother could enter one's mind with a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.27,0:49:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我只能弄脏我的手\N{\fs10}I have to get my hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.49,0:49:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}让我来\N{\fs10}I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.24,0:50:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}让我来...\N{\fs10}I've got you...
