Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.93,1:08:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}四个人 是万磁王吗\N{\fs10}There's four... Hey, wait. Is it Magneto?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.41,1:08:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我和蔼的老天爷 一定要是万磁王...\N{\fs10}Dear sweet God in heaven, let it be Magneto...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.93,1:08:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-因为他... -他死了\N{\fs10}-because with him... -He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.98,1:08:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}操 迪士尼竟然在这里省钱\N{\fs10}Fuck! Now Disney gets cheap?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.90,1:08:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就像匹诺曹把脸卡在我屁股里 呐喊着自己是个炮机\N{\fs10}It's like Pinocchio jammed his face in my ass and started lying like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.52,1:08:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你好骚啊\N{\fs10}Ooh, you nasty!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.70,1:08:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这小红帽 裆下过着没羞没臊的性福生活\N{\fs10}Mon petit rouge. Laissez les bons temps rouler, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.78,1:08:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}完全没听懂 你到底是干嘛的\N{\fs10}Not a single word. What do you do exactly?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.66,1:08:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}给纸牌赋能 然后来个炸裂效果\N{\fs10}Charge the playing cards and make them go boom!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.41,1:08:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你的能力是近景魔术 很棒\N{\fs10}Your power's close up magic. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.53,1:08:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们胜券在握了\N{\fs10}We're not totally fucked at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.13,1:08:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}谁带我们来的\N{\fs10}So who brought us here?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.79,1:09:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}是我\N{\fs10}That would be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.05,1:09:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}希望我不后悔\N{\fs10}Don't make me regret it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.14,1:09:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}靠\N{\fs10}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.25,1:09:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}罗根 是她 X-23\N{\fs10}Logan. That's her. That's X-23.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.56,1:09:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就是我跟你说的那个\N{\fs10}She's the one I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.60,1:09:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你们怎么会困在虚空里\N{\fs10}Hey, how did you all get stuck in The Void?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.85,1:09:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}一天有人敲门\N{\fs10}There was a knock at the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.36,1:09:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-时变局把我扔到这 -我也是\N{\fs10}-TVA sent me here. -Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.38,1:09:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}也许我就是在这里出生的 很难讲\N{\fs10}Well, maybe I was born here. It's, it's hard to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.27,1:09:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}时变局判定我们的宇宙即将毁灭\N{\fs10}TVA decided our universe was dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.49,1:09:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我连最后斗争的机会都没有\N{\fs10}And I never even got a chance to fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.21,1:09:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}因为我们不会保持沉默\N{\fs10}People like us don't go quietly.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.46,1:09:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}时变局很清楚这一点 直接不给我们机会\N{\fs10}TVA knows that, so they took us out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.00,1:09:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我愿意 我加入\N{\fs10}The answer is yes. I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.18,1:09:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-加入什么 -团队\N{\fs10}-In what? -A team.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.11,1:09:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我 你 你 和我 大家齐心协力\N{\fs10}Me, you, you, and me. All of us together.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.30,1:09:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-一起离开这鬼地方 -别听他的 他是个...\N{\fs10}-Let's get the fuck out of this place. -Don't listen to him. He's...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.94,1:09:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-狗日的骗子 -那是合理的饼\N{\fs10}-a fucking liar! -It was an educated wish!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.01,1:09:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}听着\N{\fs10}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.39,1:10:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们去过卡桑德拉的基地\N{\fs10}We've been inside Cassandra's lair.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.39,1:10:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}只有通过她才能离开虚空\N{\fs10}The only way out of The Void is through her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.10,1:10:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}她能让我们回去\N{\fs10}She can get us home.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.40,1:10:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-她亲口说的 -等一下 你们去过她的基地？\N{\fs10}-She told us. -Wait a minute, you've been inside?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.36,1:10:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-还活着出来？ -胡扯\N{\fs10}-And you made it out alive? -Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.32,1:10:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-没人能做到 -我们做到了\N{\fs10}-Nobody's ever done that. -We did.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.07,1:10:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}每次我们有人对抗她...\N{\fs10}Every time one of us has gone up against her...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.74,1:10:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}全都死了\N{\fs10}they die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.03,1:10:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}惩罚者 快银 夜魔侠\N{\fs10}The Punisher, The Quicksilver, The Daredevil.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.91,1:10:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}夜魔侠 真遗憾\N{\fs10}Daredevil? I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.41,1:10:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-没关系 -好吧\N{\fs10}-It's fine. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.87,1:10:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就连心地善良的强尼·斯通也是\N{\fs10}Even that sweet, baby angel, Johnny Storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.08,1:10:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他离开还没多久...\N{\fs10}He up and gone missing like...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.92,1:10:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}差不多两天前\N{\fs10}what, two days ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.24,1:10:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}太可惜了\N{\fs10}That's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.05,1:10:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不管这位强尼在哪 他会没事的\N{\fs10}Wherever this Johnny fella is, I'm sure he's thriving.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.97,1:10:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}人多好办事 我们两个\N{\fs10}Look, there's, there's strength in numbers. All right? Us...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.23,1:10:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}再加上你们 我们能击败卡桑德拉\N{\fs10}plus, you guys. We can put Cassandra over our knee...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.55,1:10:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}逼她让我们离开虚空\N{\fs10}and force her to let us out of The Void.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.13,1:10:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我很了解自我怀疑的感觉\N{\fs10}I know what it means to feel self-doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.78,1:10:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-我没那感觉 -我好得很\N{\fs10}-I don't feel that at all. -I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.40,1:10:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就像肚子里有条嗨起来的寄生虫\N{\fs10}Gnawing at your gut like a coked-up tapeworm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.49,1:10:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你说出了我的心声\N{\fs10}It's like you're holding up a mirror to my soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.32,1:10:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}也许你们没能拯救自己的宇宙\N{\fs10}You guys may not have been able to save your universes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.11,1:10:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但你们可以为它复仇\N{\fs10}But you can avenge them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.36,1:10:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这也是强尼所希望的\N{\fs10}It's what Johnny would have wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.82,1:10:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}等等\N{\fs10}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.30,1:11:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你见过强尼？\N{\fs10}You knew Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.58,1:11:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}没错\N{\fs10}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.91,1:11:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这蠢蛋忽悠着他一起走...\N{\fs10}Dickhead here talked him into a team up...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.80,1:11:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}结果强尼确诊为挂了\N{\fs10}and Johnny came down with a little case of the deads.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.15,1:11:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不不 说不准的\N{\fs10}No, no, no. We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.67,1:11:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}只是点皮肉伤 可能还活着\N{\fs10}It was just a flesh wound. He may have survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.89,1:11:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就算活着 他也宁可死掉\N{\fs10}If he survived that, he is praying for death.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.75,1:11:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-谢谢金刚狼医师 -快说\N{\fs10}-Thank you, Doctor Wolverine! -Spill it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.25,1:11:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你把强尼怎么了\N{\fs10}What'd you do to Johnny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.77,1:11:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}再不说我就动手了\N{\fs10}Talk or I'm gonna start dealing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.14,1:11:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}好 好\N{\fs10}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.02,1:11:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}是这样\N{\fs10}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.02,1:11:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他对卡桑德拉满嘴跑火车\N{\fs10}He ran his fat-ass mouth about Cassandra.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.47,1:11:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}然后她抬手就扒掉了他的皮...\N{\fs10}Then she zip-zapped his skin...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.39,1:11:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}内脏散落到地上...\N{\fs10}leaving his organs to splash crudely onto the ground...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.57,1:11:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}血液渗进土里 景象让人不寒而栗\N{\fs10}while the soil greedily drank his blood. It was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.28,1:11:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他就像我的兄弟一样\N{\fs10}He was like a brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.23,1:11:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}既然他壮志未酬身先死...\N{\fs10}Look, he died before he could make a difference. But...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.40,1:11:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}或许你们救不了你们的世界...\N{\fs10}Look, maybe you couldn't save your worlds, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.97,1:11:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但是 你们能挽救我的世界\N{\fs10}but Jesus Christ, you can save mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.62,1:11:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我并不在乎你的世界 不过...\N{\fs10}I don't give a shit about your world, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.24,1:11:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}如果这两个都能活着出来 或许我们联手...\N{\fs10}if these two made it out of there alive, maybe together...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.21,1:11:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就能杀进去 合力干掉她\N{\fs10}we can get back in. And take her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.13,1:11:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}在我老家\N{\fs10}Where I come from,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.55,1:11:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}那叫自杀 亲爱的\N{\fs10}we call that suicide, Chere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.13,1:11:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}只要封住她的读心能力 我们就有机会\N{\fs10}If we can block her psychic powers, we can get a leg up. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.00,1:11:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我知道万磁王死了\N{\fs10}Now I know Magneto's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.10,1:12:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但我敢说他的头盔...\N{\fs10}But I'd venture to guess that his helmet...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.18,1:12:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-还在某个地方... -卡桑德拉烧熔了那头盔\N{\fs10}-is lying around here somewhere... -Cassandra melted the helmet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.72,1:12:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-操 -在她杀了他之后\N{\fs10}-Fuck! -After she killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.01,1:12:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}操\N{\fs10}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.10,1:12:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}她要以绝后患\N{\fs10}She don't play.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.95,1:12:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}她知道那头盔是唯一能屏蔽她能力的东西\N{\fs10}She knows that helmet was the only way to protect anyone from her powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.98,1:12:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}红坦克的头盔也有同样效果 但是...\N{\fs10}The only other helmet that strong is Juggernaut's, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.25,1:12:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-他们是一伙的 -红坦克的头盔 就是它了\N{\fs10}-he works for Cassandra. -Juggernaut's helmet. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.53,1:12:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不过想要把那顶头盔摘下来\N{\fs10}Yeah, and we done be knowing that lid ain't coming off...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.25,1:12:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-只有砍下他的头 -抱歉 帅哥\N{\fs10}-without that dome gonna come off wit'it. -I'm so sorry, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.99,1:12:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}冒昧地问一句 你这口音是跟谁学的\N{\fs10}I want this to be gentle. Who is your dialect coach?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.45,1:12:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}小黄人吗\N{\fs10}The Minions?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.60,1:12:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}感觉我们都没找对剧本的中心思想\N{\fs10}I feel like we are missing critical exposition here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.91,1:12:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我受够了 受够了躲藏\N{\fs10}I'm sick of this shit. I'm sick of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.92,1:12:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们的世界早已忘了我们\N{\fs10}Let's face it, our worlds forgot about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.00,1:12:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}或根本不知道我们\N{\fs10}Or never learned about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.79,1:12:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们曾是英雄\N{\fs10}The heroes we were.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.25,1:12:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}曾经拯救众生\N{\fs10}Lives we saved.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.54,1:12:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}或曾想去拯救\N{\fs10}Or wanted to save.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.18,1:12:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}也许这两个人就是我们的机会\N{\fs10}Maybe these two are our chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.35,1:12:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}至留名青史\N{\fs10}To be remembered.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.83,1:12:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们原本的道路\N{\fs10}The way we deserve.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.26,1:12:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}对味儿了\N{\fs10}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.39,1:12:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}原本的结局\N{\fs10}An ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.19,1:12:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-成为传奇 -对\N{\fs10}-Legacy. -Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.48,1:12:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}听听大哥说的\N{\fs10}Yes! Let this man cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.23,1:12:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这才是该有的样子\N{\fs10}This is what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.59,1:12:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}大场面动作戏加慢镜头 配上悲壮的音乐\N{\fs10}Big slow-motion fights, sad music.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.65,1:12:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}所有人并肩作战 出生入死的那种\N{\fs10}Everybody working together. Who knows if you live or die? That sort a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.78,1:12:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-都准备好了吗 -随时出手\N{\fs10}-Who's ready? -I was born ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.95,1:13:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}爽 牌皇？\N{\fs10}Yes! Gambit?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.05,1:13:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我没见过我父亲 但我被射出屌的那刻就准备好了\N{\fs10}I ain't know my daddy, but I'm sure I shot out of his dick ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.20,1:13:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}天啊 真有画面感\N{\fs10}Jesus Christ, that is graphic.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.12,1:13:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}当时老爸给老妈把蛋都塞进去...\N{\fs10}Yeah. He was laying them buttery nuts all up in my mama...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.17,1:13:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我一冒出头就说 你好啊哥们儿\N{\fs10}and I shot out there and I said, "What's up, Doc?"
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.79,1:13:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}强尼跟你肯定很铁 X-23 你呢\N{\fs10}Johnny must have loved you. X-23, what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.78,1:13:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我叫劳拉\N{\fs10}The name's Laura.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.98,1:13:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-跟他们决一死战 -决一死战\N{\fs10}-Let's fucking go. -Let's fucking go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.09,1:13:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-别让人看扁了 -对\N{\fs10}-It's on like chicken and corn. -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.89,1:13:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-就这么干 -你们都他妈死定了\N{\fs10}-We're doing this. -You're all fucking dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.97,1:13:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我靠 刚才多好的气势\N{\fs10}My God! Read the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.96,1:13:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我不想跟人说话 回去吧\N{\fs10}I'm not looking for company. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.16,1:13:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你让我想到他\N{\fs10}You remind me of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.95,1:13:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}爱生气 醉醺醺 凶巴巴\N{\fs10}Angry. Drunk. Mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.83,1:13:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-听起来不错... -还没讲完\N{\fs10}-Sounds like a great guy... -Wasn't finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.75,1:13:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}在最关键的时候从不缺席\N{\fs10}Showed up when it mattered the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.54,1:13:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}没有什么能阻挡他\N{\fs10}Couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.55,1:13:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你可能没意识到 但...\N{\fs10}You might not know it, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.97,1:14:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你是个好人 罗根\N{\fs10}you're a good man, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.43,1:14:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你可能没意识到 很明显 我是最糟糕的罗根\N{\fs10}You might not know it, but apparently, I'm the worst Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.35,1:14:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}因为你 我才能活下来\N{\fs10}I got to have a life because of you.
