Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.61,1:14:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这套战衣说你是\N{\fs10}That suit says different.
