Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.57,1:15:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不 让我...\N{\fs10}No, no, let me...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.12,1:15:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}让我说出来...\N{\fs10}Let me say it. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.87,1:15:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我需要说出来\N{\fs10}I need to say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.71,1:15:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}等我醉醺醺地回去 为时已晚\N{\fs10}By the time I stumbled home shitfaced from the bar, it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.46,1:15:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他们死了 全死了\N{\fs10}They were dead. Every...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.18,1:15:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}只有这套战衣能提醒我 他们是谁\N{\fs10}This suit's all I got to remind me of who they were.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.15,1:15:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}提醒我做了什么\N{\fs10}And what I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.33,1:15:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们天亮出发去找卡桑德拉\N{\fs10}We're headed to Cassandra's at sunup.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.83,1:15:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}一路顺风 我不参与\N{\fs10}Have fun. Not my fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.13,1:16:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}少了你不会成功的\N{\fs10}We won't pull this off without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.52,1:16:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不管你以为我是谁 你找错人了\N{\fs10}Whoever you think I am, you got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.89,1:16:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你本来就不是我要找的人\N{\fs10}You were always the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.25,1:16:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}什么事\N{\fs10}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.25,1:16:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}艾利奥斯没解决他们\N{\fs10}Alioth didn't get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.67,1:16:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}卡桑德拉想先自己陪他们玩\N{\fs10}Cassandra wanted to play with them herself first.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.05,1:16:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}结果他们逃掉了\N{\fs10}They got away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.05,1:16:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-他们找到其他人了？ -没有\N{\fs10}-Did they find the others? -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.85,1:16:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}那就好\N{\fs10}Good. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.17,1:16:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}是其他人找到他们\N{\fs10}The others found them.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.43,1:16:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你说话真风趣 火人 一点也不俗套\N{\fs10}Oh, very cute. Well done, Pyro. Classic bait and switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.13,1:16:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-被你的幽默感折服了 -放轻松\N{\fs10}-You really got me there. -Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.65,1:17:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}如果他们和诺瓦开战 都会被她搞定（诺瓦是卡桑德拉的中间名）\N{\fs10}If they come after Nova, she'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.11,1:17:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}卡桑德拉疯起来无人可挡\N{\fs10}Cassandra is a lunatic wild card.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.23,1:17:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你以为我们为什么把她放在这\N{\fs10}Why do you think we put her there in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.52,1:17:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}幸好她自己没想要离开虚空\N{\fs10}Thank God she's never chosen to leave The Void.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.65,1:17:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}时间开膛手再几小时就能启动了\N{\fs10}The Time Ripper is hours away from completion.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.37,1:17:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我不能冒险\N{\fs10}I can not take any chances.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.66,1:17:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你是不能\N{\fs10}Well, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.87,1:17:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但我可以\N{\fs10}But I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.12,1:17:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}只要钱到位\N{\fs10}For a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.24,1:17:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-你声音怎么一直怪怪的 都生理不适了\N{\fs10}-Why do you have to say it in that silly voice? It's so icky.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.09,1:17:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不行就拉倒\N{\fs10}You want it done or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.13,1:17:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}好 就听你的\N{\fs10}All right. Your price.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.16,1:17:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}干掉她\N{\fs10}Take her out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.04,1:17:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}该死的变种人\N{\fs10}Ugh. Mutants.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.81,1:17:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}看那边\N{\fs10}Ooh! Look at that there!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.06,1:17:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就是那双大手 从没有人想冲进去\N{\fs10}You see them biggum hands come closed. Ain't not a wonna getting up inside there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.87,1:17:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}牌皇想说的是...\N{\fs10}I think what Gambit's trying to say is...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.36,1:17:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}想拿到红坦克的头盔可不简单\N{\fs10}getting Juggernaut's helmet ain't gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.24,1:17:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我瞎编的...\N{\fs10}I'm just making stuff up at this...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.03,1:17:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-镜头对准刀锋战士 -上炮\N{\fs10}-Yeah. Tilt up to Blade. -Gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.50,1:18:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这宝贝哪弄来的\N{\fs10}Where'd he get that little beauty?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.17,1:18:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}惩罚者的AT4火箭筒\N{\fs10}That's Punisher's AT4.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.42,1:18:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}哪个惩罚者 已经有五个版本了\N{\fs10}Which Punisher? There's been like five of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.59,1:18:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但只有一个刀锋战士\N{\fs10}There's only been one Blade...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.47,1:18:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}而且永远只有这一个刀锋战士\N{\fs10}and there's only ever gonna be one Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.43,1:18:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}敌袭\N{\fs10}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.37,1:19:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这下有得爽了\N{\fs10}Ooh, this is gonna be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.70,1:19:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}知道这一刻我等了多久吗\N{\fs10}You know how long I've been waiting for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.13,1:19:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}今天要一战成名了\N{\fs10}I'm about to make a name for myself here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.46,1:19:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}恐怕你们没办法全身而退\N{\fs10}I don't think you guys walk away from this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.46,1:19:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你们只要把今天的一切告诉人们\N{\fs10}You just make sure people know what happened here today.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.63,1:19:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}出去之后别忘了敬我一杯\N{\fs10}And when you get out of here, you have a drink for me, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.76,1:19:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你们不必在意敌人 找机会突围\N{\fs10}You just stay on our six and get inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.27,1:19:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们会拿到那件东西\N{\fs10}We'll make sure you get the package.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.68,1:19:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}和我们原本的结局\N{\fs10}And we'll get our ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.17,1:20:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}砰\N{\fs10}And boom!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.95,1:21:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}总有傻逼急着上来送死\N{\fs10}Some motherfuckers still trying to ice skate uphill.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.13,1:21:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你们俩逃掉也就算了\N{\fs10}You two escaping, I could live with.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.43,1:21:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}竟然又主动跑回来\N{\fs10}But coming back? Willingly?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.72,1:21:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}男人就是蠢\N{\fs10}Boys are so silly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.64,1:21:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我只想回家\N{\fs10}I just need to get home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.85,1:21:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}恐怕没这个选项\N{\fs10}Well, that's not on the menu, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.40,1:21:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}要么战死要么奴隶 二选一\N{\fs10}It's death or enslavement. A la carte, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.81,1:21:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}举高高\N{\fs10}Upsy-daisy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.66,1:21:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}总算...\N{\fs10}Finally...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.70,1:22:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}可以换个人唠会儿\N{\fs10}it's nice to give someone elsea chance to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.74,1:22:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}恕我直言\N{\fs10}Not my strong suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.47,1:22:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你就要后悔了\N{\fs10}You shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.52,1:22:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}再见了 混蛋\N{\fs10}Adiós, pendejo
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.28,1:22:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你就是有点特别的那个吧\N{\fs10}You are an interesting one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.29,1:22:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我能感觉到你被他那些洗脑...\N{\fs10}I do feel like you get lost behind all of his...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.58,1:22:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}死侍在虚空里随处可见\N{\fs10}Deadpools are a dime a dozen here in The Void.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.05,1:23:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但你...\N{\fs10}But you...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.92,1:23:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这里到底有什么\N{\fs10}What's going on in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.48,1:23:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}有意思...\N{\fs10}Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.78,1:23:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}出乎我意料\N{\fs10}Not what I expected back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.78,1:23:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}在愤怒的背后\N{\fs10}Behind the anger.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.11,1:23:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你在逃避\N{\fs10}You're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.37,1:23:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}逃避他们\N{\fs10}From them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.41,1:23:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}逃避那些对你失望的人\N{\fs10}From all the ones you let down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.75,1:23:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}真痛苦\N{\fs10}So much pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.55,1:23:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我一走了之\N{\fs10}I walked away.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.84,1:23:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他们挽留我\N{\fs10}They called after me and I...
