Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.51,1:23:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我总是如此\N{\fs10}I always do.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.30,1:23:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-罗根 -我知道\N{\fs10}-Logan! -I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.43,1:23:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不止这些\N{\fs10}That's not all you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.52,1:23:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}对吗\N{\fs10}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.85,1:23:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你最后找到他们\N{\fs10}You found them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.23,1:24:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}X战警\N{\fs10}The X-Men.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.65,1:24:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}都死了\N{\fs10}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.41,1:24:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}尸积如山\N{\fs10}Piled like wood.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.33,1:24:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}然后你做了什么\N{\fs10}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.20,1:24:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我开始杀戮\N{\fs10}I started killing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.25,1:24:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}停不下来 也不想停\N{\fs10}And I couldn't stop. I didn't wanna stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.00,1:24:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他们都该死\N{\fs10}All those bad men.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.59,1:24:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}并没有这样结束\N{\fs10}It's not just the bad ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.85,1:24:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我的小野兽\N{\fs10}My little animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.89,1:24:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}因为我 全世界都敌视X战警\N{\fs10}And I turned the whole world against the X-Men.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.29,1:24:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}刀锋战士\N{\fs10}Blade!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.65,1:24:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}只有这一次\N{\fs10}Just once...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.83,1:24:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我想成为查尔斯期盼的样子\N{\fs10}I wanna be the man that Charles thought I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.63,1:24:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}罗根\N{\fs10}Logan...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.28,1:24:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}在虚空里 你就是原本的样子\N{\fs10}in The Void you can be what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.38,1:25:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我只想自由\N{\fs10}I just wanna be free.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.63,1:25:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我能给你自由\N{\fs10}I can set you free.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.72,1:25:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我能让所有嘈杂归于寂静\N{\fs10}I can silence all those voices.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.69,1:25:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我来助你\N{\fs10}I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.32,1:25:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}解脱一切\N{\fs10}I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.07,1:25:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不用\N{\fs10}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.37,1:25:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我抓住你了\N{\fs10}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.08,1:25:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}拿下来\N{\fs10}Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.88,1:25:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}送我们回家 不然把你这秃头拧下来\N{\fs10}You're gonna send us home, or I'm gonna twist your fucking head off.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.18,1:25:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你笑什么\N{\fs10}Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.93,1:25:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}戴着这东西 我没法送你们回去\N{\fs10}I can't send you home unless you get this thing off my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.30,1:25:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但只要你摘了它\N{\fs10}And as soon as you do that...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.62,1:26:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我就把你们的脑浆蒸发到原子级...\N{\fs10}I'm going to boil your brains on an atomic level...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.30,1:26:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}听着恩雅的专辑套装 玩着自己的欢乐豆（恩雅暗喻圣洁的声音）\N{\fs10}whilst flicking my bean to the Enya box set.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.40,1:26:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}恩雅还有专辑套装？\N{\fs10}There's an Enya box set?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.60,1:26:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}要么弄死两位\N{\fs10}Either you kill me...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.16,1:26:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}要么被两位弄死\N{\fs10}or I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.24,1:26:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}两种选择都不赖\N{\fs10}Both wonderful options.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.32,1:26:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}要我动手吗\N{\fs10}You want me to do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.61,1:26:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不 我自己来\N{\fs10}No, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.66,1:26:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}她脖子就在我手里\N{\fs10}I have her neck right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.96,1:26:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-方便的很 -你办不了\N{\fs10}-It's really no problem. -You'll screw it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.74,1:26:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}得了吧 除了最后一部 你全系列PG-13（辅导级）\N{\fs10}Oh, come on, Mr. PG-13, except the last one!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.17,1:26:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}搞什么鬼\N{\fs10}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.58,1:26:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你没尝过那种滋味\N{\fs10}You have no idea what it's like!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.09,1:26:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}日复一日 与人为奴\N{\fs10}Day after day. Shovel the shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.09,1:26:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}摇尾乞怜\N{\fs10}Fetch the meats.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.73,1:26:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我几乎已经...\N{\fs10}I have spent my entire...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.55,1:26:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}轮不到你说话\N{\fs10}Not everyone gets a speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.02,1:26:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}她快死了\N{\fs10}She's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.19,1:26:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}好 如果我摘掉头盔...\N{\fs10}Okay. If I take this helmet off...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.81,1:26:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-你保证不杀我们 -操\N{\fs10}-do you promise you won't kill us? -Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.77,1:26:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我保证...\N{\fs10}I promise...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.77,1:26:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}第一个先杀你\N{\fs10}I will kill you first thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.73,1:26:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}怎么这么个玩意儿\N{\fs10}Why are you like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.14,1:26:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我也想知道\N{\fs10}I wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.57,1:26:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}摘下来\N{\fs10}Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.61,1:26:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-什么 -摘下来\N{\fs10}-What? -Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.65,1:26:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-为什么 -快摘下来\N{\fs10}-Why? -Just take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.65,1:26:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-这是拯救我们世界的唯一机会 -摘下来\N{\fs10}-This is our only chance to fix our shit! -Take it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.32,1:26:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我穿着这套战衣\N{\fs10}I am wearing this suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.79,1:27:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}它有着很多意义 但最重要的是...\N{\fs10}And that means a lot of things, but most of all...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.41,1:27:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}它代表我是X战警\N{\fs10}it means I'm an X-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.66,1:27:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我了解你哥\N{\fs10}And I know your brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.42,1:27:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}尽管我很想杀了你...\N{\fs10}As much as I want to fucking kill you...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.09,1:27:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}身上每根骨头都想杀了你...\N{\fs10}every bone in my body wants to fucking kill you...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.76,1:27:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}但他决不会让我站在这看着你死\N{\fs10}he would not let me stand here and watch you die!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.23,1:27:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}把手放开\N{\fs10}Take your hands off.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.10,1:27:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这是为了他\N{\fs10}This is for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.27,1:27:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}为了查尔斯\N{\fs10}This is for Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.15,1:27:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不 不 不 我不想变成强尼那样\N{\fs10}Hey, no, no, no! Don't you dare do me like Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.12,1:27:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我哥爱你\N{\fs10}My brother loved you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.09,1:27:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他爱我们大家\N{\fs10}He loved all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.26,1:27:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}感觉一定很好\N{\fs10}Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.46,1:27:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他也会爱你\N{\fs10}He would've loved you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.64,1:28:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}如果他知道你的状况...\N{\fs10}If he knew about you...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.60,1:28:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}如果他知道你在哪...\N{\fs10}if he knew where you were...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.27,1:28:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}哪怕把宇宙开个洞 他也会带你回家\N{\fs10}he would've torn a hole in the fucking universe to bring you home.
