Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.64,1:28:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}是你们回家的路\N{\fs10}This is your way home.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.72,1:28:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我是该报答救命之恩 但还想来点好玩的\N{\fs10}I do owe you for saving my life. But let's keep things interesting.
