Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.26,1:43:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}彼得在每个死侍的世界都是传奇\N{\fs10}Shit. Peter's a goddamn legend in every Deadpool's world.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.01,1:43:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}彼得桑\N{\fs10}Peter-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.48,1:44:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}彼得...\N{\fs10}Peter. Peter. Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.61,1:44:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}太棒了 我的彼得\N{\fs10}Enjoy my Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.72,1:44:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}现在你们来了 太迟了 都结束了\N{\fs10}Oh, now you're here. Oh, well, you're too late. It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.35,1:44:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}还没有\N{\fs10}Not yet, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.35,1:44:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不 只差一点点了\N{\fs10}No, no, no. We're very close.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.18,1:44:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}最后冲刺 我保证\N{\fs10}Homestretch, folks. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.68,1:44:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}该放手一搏了\N{\fs10}Quick, let's up the stakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.36,1:44:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}如果她窃取了时间开膛手的能量...\N{\fs10}If she steals the Time Ripper's energy...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.86,1:44:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就能瓦解所有的现实结构...\N{\fs10}she has the power to shred the fabric of all realities...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.48,1:44:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}最后只剩虚空存在\N{\fs10}until there is nothing left but The Void.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.28,1:44:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}怎么关了它\N{\fs10}How do we shut it down?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.47,1:44:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不知道\N{\fs10}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.33,1:45:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}现在知道吗\N{\fs10}How about now?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.44,1:45:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这张面具很吓人吧\N{\fs10}The mask is really intimidating, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.99,1:45:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就像蝙蝠侠 但他可以转头\N{\fs10}It's like Batman, except he can move his neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.24,1:45:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}好 好 听我说\N{\fs10}Okay, look, look, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.12,1:45:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}时间开膛手由地下的安全屋供能\N{\fs10}The Ripper is fed from a secure chamber below ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.67,1:45:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}通过汇聚在内部的物质与反物质驱动\N{\fs10}It is powered by twin matter and anti-matter feeds converging inside the device.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.89,1:45:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}卡桑德拉·诺瓦正在...\N{\fs10}Now, Cassandra Nova...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.02,1:45:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}重新定向开膛手的能量 来终结所有时间线...\N{\fs10}is redirecting the Ripper's power to eliminate all timelines...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.82,1:45:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就从这条开始\N{\fs10}starting with this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.84,1:45:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}理论上 你们也能阻止她...\N{\fs10}Theoretically, you could stop her...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.26,1:45:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}需要让地下安全屋的供能短路\N{\fs10}by short-circuiting the feeds in the chamber below.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.30,1:45:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}两条供能线路短接后...\N{\fs10}One of you were to create a circuit between the two feeds...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.97,1:45:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}释放出的能量就会摧毁时间开膛手\N{\fs10}then the released power would destroy the machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.18,1:45:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-但是 这... -快说\N{\fs10}-But, well, but... -Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.15,1:45:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}咽不下去 就说出来\N{\fs10}If you're not gonna swallow, spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.32,1:45:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不管谁接通这股能量 都会死\N{\fs10}Whoever formed the bridge would be annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.52,1:45:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-我不会死 -我也可以\N{\fs10}-I could live with that. -Yeah, I could live with that, too, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.32,1:45:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我们就像打不死的小强\N{\fs10}You know, we survive anything. We're like cockroaches.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.41,1:45:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这次不一样\N{\fs10}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.53,1:45:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这是物质和反物质\N{\fs10}This is matter and anti-matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.25,1:45:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}它们彼此互为反状态\N{\fs10}They do not play nicely with each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.20,1:45:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}如果在体内相遇 你会湮灭成原子级\N{\fs10}When they mix in your body, you will be atomized.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.53,1:45:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不信我也得信科学\N{\fs10}Trust the laws of physics, if you don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.68,1:45:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就算能撑着把线路短接 但能量释放时...\N{\fs10}Even if you lived long enough to make the circuit...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.92,1:45:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你也会当场送命\N{\fs10}you will die down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.82,1:46:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}慢着\N{\fs10}Hold off. Hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.53,1:46:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你听到楼上那混蛋说的\N{\fs10}You heard that asshole upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.21,1:46:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就算成功 我们也是死\N{\fs10}Even if we pull this off, we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.15,1:46:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}彻底死亡\N{\fs10}Permanently.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.66,1:46:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}所以得由我去\N{\fs10}That's why it's got to be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.22,1:46:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}什么\N{\fs10}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.63,1:46:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}听着...\N{\fs10}Look, man...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.71,1:46:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这本来与你无关\N{\fs10}you didn't ask for any of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.92,1:46:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你说得对\N{\fs10}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.39,1:46:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我骗了你\N{\fs10}I lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.26,1:46:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我说那些谎话...\N{\fs10}I lied right to your face...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.14,1:46:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}只是为了让你帮我 你已经做的够多了\N{\fs10}just to get you to help me. And you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.93,1:46:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你没骗我\N{\fs10}You didn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.40,1:46:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你是画了个合理的饼\N{\fs10}You made an educated wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.85,1:46:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}别忘了\N{\fs10}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.10,1:47:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你还有个世界在等你回去\N{\fs10}You got a whole world to go back to.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.53,1:47:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我一无所有\N{\fs10}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.70,1:47:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}一无所有\N{\fs10}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.70,1:47:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}还是让我来吧\N{\fs10}Give me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.51,1:47:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我等了好久才跟你联手\N{\fs10}I waited a long time for this team up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.63,1:47:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你知道吗\N{\fs10}You know something?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.64,1:47:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你是最棒的金刚狼\N{\fs10}You were the best Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.03,1:47:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}替我问候你的朋友们\N{\fs10}Say hi to your friends for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.91,1:47:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不\N{\fs10}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.16,1:47:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}开门\N{\fs10}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.29,1:48:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你这牺牲太高尚 我都听不见了\N{\fs10}I can't hear you over all the noble sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.09,1:48:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你这是为了什么\N{\fs10}Why are you fucking doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.60,1:48:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}因为我是...\N{\fs10}Because I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.10,1:48:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}漫威救世主\N{\fs10}Marvel Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.22,1:48:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}或者星际迷航里的斯波克\N{\fs10}Or Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.47,1:48:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不好说\N{\fs10}Hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.10,1:48:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}韦德\N{\fs10}Wade!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.68,1:48:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你这个白痴\N{\fs10}You fucking idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.82,1:48:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}抱歉 我在拖时间\N{\fs10}Sorry, I'm just stalling.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.45,1:48:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}真要牺牲了还是有点慌啊\N{\fs10}I think I'm nervous about dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.24,1:48:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}本应让我去\N{\fs10}This should be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.07,1:48:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}替我问候我的朋友们 小狼狗\N{\fs10}Say hi to my friends for me, peanut.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.06,1:48:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}韦德\N{\fs10}Wade!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.98,1:48:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你想继续嘴贱 就给我过来\N{\fs10}You want to be an annoying prick, do it this side!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.29,1:48:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你会死在这 你个傻子\N{\fs10}You're gonna die in there, you dumb fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.34,1:48:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}嘿 你不需要这么做\N{\fs10}Hey! You don't need to do this.
