Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.38,1:52:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}也许你该去问卡桑德拉·诺瓦\N{\fs10}Maybe you should ask Cassandra Nova.
