Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.13,1:53:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}她会一直乖乖关在虚空里 结果却没有...\N{\fs10}that she was safely held in The Void. But no...
