Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.23,1:53:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}亦是我的朋友\N{\fs10}My friends.
