Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.03,1:53:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就证明了他们有多英勇\N{\fs10}is a testament to their heroism.
