Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.69,1:53:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他重生了 小宝贝\N{\fs10}He has risen, baby girl.
