Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.71,1:54:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}确实很好\N{\fs10}Fine indeed.
