Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.02,1:54:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}把你油亮的奶子收起来 发骚的婊\N{\fs10}Put your greasy tits away, you preening slut.
