Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.10,1:54:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}没错 一个人去 确实会死\N{\fs10}You were right. One of us would have been killed.
