Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.91,1:54:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就坚不可摧 你妈逼的\N{\fs10}indestructible, motherfucker.
