Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.58,1:54:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-等等 什么 -不 其实...\N{\fs10}-Wait, hold on. What? -Nope. Actually...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.70,1:54:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他就是这个宇宙的 跟我一样\N{\fs10}This one's homegrown, like me.
