Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.03,1:54:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}彼得侍 可以叫我彼得\N{\fs10}Peterpool. But you can call me Peter.
