Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.75,1:55:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这他妈什么情况\N{\fs10}What the fuck is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.34,1:55:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你将会受到审判...\N{\fs10}You are under judgment...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.18,1:55:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}因启动未经批准的时间开膛手\N{\fs10}for operating an unsanctioned Time Ripper.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.22,1:55:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-带走 -我只是做了你们不敢于做的事\N{\fs10}-Take him. -I was just doing what you don't have the guts to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.47,1:55:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}放开你的脏手\N{\fs10}Get your insolent hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.02,1:55:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}放开\N{\fs10}Get off!
