Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.60,1:55:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}鞠躬就免了\N{\fs10}Let's hold the bows.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.85,1:55:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你把一个欧米茄级的变种人带到了这条时间线\N{\fs10}You led an Omega-level mutant to this timeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.44,1:55:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不客气\N{\fs10}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.44,1:55:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-你本不应该出现在这里 -他也不客气\N{\fs10}-And you shouldn't even be near this timeline. -He's welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.36,1:55:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}而你 穿这套战衣帅简直太帅了\N{\fs10}And you look damn good in that suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.78,1:55:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}抱歉帅着你了\N{\fs10}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.29,1:55:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我有个不得了的东西给你们看\N{\fs10}I wanna show you something. Something huge.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.08,1:55:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}童子军团长凯文也常这么说\N{\fs10}That's what Scoutmaster Kevin used to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.62,1:55:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}看到了吗\N{\fs10}Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.38,1:55:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你的宇宙正在恢复\N{\fs10}Your universe is regenerating.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.05,1:55:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不管你在这里做了什么\N{\fs10}Whatever you did here...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.80,1:55:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你不只拯救了你的世界\N{\fs10}you not only saved your world.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.22,1:55:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}也让你的时间线免于湮灭\N{\fs10}You spared your timeline from extinction.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.44,1:55:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我该走了\N{\fs10}I'd rest up.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.89,1:55:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}看起来你的工作才刚刚开始\N{\fs10}I have a feeling your work is only just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.44,1:55:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}演到90岁\N{\fs10}Till you're 90.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.14,1:56:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}等等\N{\fs10}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.45,1:56:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}多亏了有人相助我们才能离开虚空\N{\fs10}We couldn't have made it out of The Void without some help...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.99,1:56:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他们却被世界遗忘了\N{\fs10}from some people that the world kind of forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.36,1:56:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}有没有什么办法能让他们回到自己的世界\N{\fs10}Is there any way that you could maybe find a way to bring them home?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.83,1:56:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我尽我所能\N{\fs10}I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.66,1:56:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我跟我朋友保证...\N{\fs10}And I promised my friend here...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.96,1:56:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}时变局能逆转他时间线的悲剧\N{\fs10}that the TVA could undo some pretty awful shit in his timeline.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.67,1:56:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}可以实现吗\N{\fs10}What would you say to that?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.97,1:56:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}改写过去？\N{\fs10}Change the past?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.63,1:56:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}他一起拯救了世界\N{\fs10}Well, he did help me save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.92,1:56:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}正是这些过往造就了如今的他\N{\fs10}And his past made him the man who did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.35,1:56:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}顺其自然吧 威尔逊先生\N{\fs10}There's nothing to fix, Mr. Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.06,1:56:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}罗根\N{\fs10}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.60,1:56:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}土耳其烤肉？\N{\fs10}Shawarma?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.56,1:56:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-就它了 -好\N{\fs10}-I could eat. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.25,1:56:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}复仇者最后也吃的土耳其烤肉\N{\fs10}You know, the Avengers discovered shawarma.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.54,1:56:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}有你加入是他们的福气\N{\fs10}They'd be lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.47,1:57:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}不会吧\N{\fs10}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.71,1:57:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}太赞了\N{\fs10}Fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.96,1:57:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}过来 我的小可爱\N{\fs10}Come here, my little cunchkin.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.67,1:57:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你才是最后的赢家\N{\fs10}Yes, it's you. You're a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.06,1:57:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这个世界太完美了\N{\fs10}Oh, all is right in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.14,1:57:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}真的\N{\fs10}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.93,1:57:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}今后有什么方向吗\N{\fs10}So what are you gonna do next?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.73,1:57:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我会找到方向的 向来如此\N{\fs10}I'll figure it out. I always do.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.61,1:57:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}好吧\N{\fs10}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.78,1:57:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}该说再见了？\N{\fs10}So I'll probably see you around?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.08,1:57:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}也许不见了\N{\fs10}Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.41,1:57:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}再见 老兄\N{\fs10}See you, bub.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.00,1:57:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}罗根\N{\fs10}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.60,1:57:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}艾尔 我回来了\N{\fs10}Al. I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.85,1:58:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}都几点了\N{\fs10}About damn time.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.47,1:58:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}带着货吗\N{\fs10}You holding?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.39,1:58:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}没有魔鬼的头皮屑（可卡因的俚语）了...\N{\fs10}I'm all outta devil's dandruff...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.30,1:58:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-哆嗦得跟最大档跳蛋一样 -谢了 艾尔\N{\fs10}-and I'm shaking like an angry vibrator. -Thank you, Al.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.40,1:58:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}有客人\N{\fs10}We have company.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.02,1:58:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}艾瑟雅 这是...\N{\fs10}Althea, this is...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.27,1:58:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这是罗根\N{\fs10}This is Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.49,1:58:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}很高兴见到你 罗根\N{\fs10}Nice to meet you, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.70,1:58:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我也是\N{\fs10}Nice to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.70,1:58:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这只菊花上的包浆屎嘎渣是玛莉·普汀\N{\fs10}And this little ancient anal shit-knot is Mary Puppins.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.41,1:58:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我喜欢叫它狗侍\N{\fs10}Or as I like to call her, Dogpool.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.76,1:58:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}要不要来一下\N{\fs10}You want to treat yourself to a little stroke?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.21,1:58:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}-那是舌头 -我操 啥鸡巴玩意\N{\fs10}-Get the tongue. There it is. -Oh, my God! Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.42,1:58:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就像犰狳猛强暴了一只地精...\N{\fs10}Right? It's like an armadillo fucked a gremlin, angrily...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.21,1:58:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}在满是淋病的床上...\N{\fs10}in a bed of gonorrhea...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.76,1:58:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}一日一天才罢休\N{\fs10}and didn't stop till the sun came up.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.35,1:58:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}人人都想有作为\N{\fs10}Everyone wants to matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.93,1:58:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}却发现不必当漫威救世主也做得到\N{\fs10}Turns out that you don't need to be Marvel Jesus to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.40,1:58:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}只要睁开眼睛 环顾四周\N{\fs10}You just need to open your eyes and look around.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.21,1:58:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}幸运的话...\N{\fs10}And if you're lucky...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.22,1:58:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你会找到几个朋友\N{\fs10}you'll find a few friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.23,1:58:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}几个老朋友...\N{\fs10}Old friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.35,1:58:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}还有一些新朋友\N{\fs10}and some new ones too.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.78,1:58:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}把狗给我 主动一点\N{\fs10}Give me the fucking dog. Talk to the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.18,1:59:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}最近很忙啊\N{\fs10}You've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.26,1:59:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我是为了你\N{\fs10}I did it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.81,1:59:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}就算你不在乎 我还是为了你\N{\fs10}And even if you don't want me, I did it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.53,1:59:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}结果...\N{\fs10}It turns out...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.24,1:59:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我就是拯救世界的料\N{\fs10}I am the world-saving type.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.57,1:59:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}看看这一桌 就是证据\N{\fs10}Just look around this table if you want proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.47,1:59:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}最棒的是什么呢\N{\fs10}And the best part?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.50,1:59:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}有时我们拯救的人...\N{\fs10}Sometimes the people we save...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.29,1:59:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}同样会拯救我们\N{\fs10}well, they save us right back.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.96,2:00:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}你不是唯一有天赋的人\N{\fs10}You're not the only one with gifts.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.25,2:00:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}这是什么地方\N{\fs10}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.44,2:01:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}战衣不错\N{\fs10}Nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.36,2:01:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}闭嘴 斯坦·李\N{\fs10}Zip it, Stan Lee.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.06,2:01:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我喜欢死侍的漫画风格\N{\fs10}I really like the, the art in the Deadpool comics.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.96,2:01:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我总觉得自己有点像他\N{\fs10}You know, I just always felt a kind of a kinship to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.38,2:01:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs20}{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}{\3c&H2F2F2F&}{\4c&H000000&}我想总有一天我会演这个角色\N{\fs10}And I just thought, I'd like to play that guy someday.
